      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EGYPTIAN QUEEN (2) goes very well this course and distance starting six times for two wins and two minors. In the money last time at Q Straight (19.24) in a Grade 5, finishing a half a length second. Looks suited and should go close. COLD COLD NIGHT (1) had a tricky draw last time when running fourth (30.48) over 525m at this track in a NG. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. A big run wouldn't surprise. MAJOR FLIRT (3) was a winner two back when prominent throughout then got further back last time and could manage only a 8 length 7th at The Gardens (30.41). One of the better hopes. VELOCITY YIN (6) has definite claims at her first try at this journey.",
